---
import NeuronExplorer from "./NeuronExplorer.astro";
---

<section class="hero" id="about" aria-labelledby="hero-name">
  <div class="shell hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-heading">
      <p class="discipline">About me</p>
      <h1 id="hero-name">Mranmay <em>Shetty</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">
        I’m a computational neuroscientist. I study how visual circuits encode
        what we see and how we remember an image after it disappears.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-details">
      <p class="hero-bio">
        I came to neuroscience through electronics engineering. I’ve worked with
        Federico Rossi on mouse visual cortex, Gabriel Kreiman on visual memory,
        Laurent Perrinet and Bruno Cessac on spike inference, and Bruno on
        retinal computation.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="button solid" href="/cv/">View CV</a>
        <a class="button quiet" href="/#publications">Publications</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Full bio</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <NeuronExplorer />
  </div>
</section>
